glish-language test if required"},{"text":"Passport"},{"text":"Financial documents"},{"text":"Scholarship essays"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech Mechanical Engineering student","Mechanical/Manufacturing Intern","Graduate Engineer Trainee","Junior Mechanical/Production/Quality Engineer","Mechanical/Production/Design Engineer","Senior Engineer","Lead Engineer / Assistant Manager","Engineering/Production Manager","Senior Manager / Engineering Head","Plant Head / Engineering Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical Engineering"},{"text":"Manufacturing Engineering"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Mechatronics"},{"text":"Thermal Engineering"},{"text":"Fluid Mechanics"},{"text":"Machine Design"},{"text":"Materials Engineering"},{"text":"Industrial Engineering"},{"text":"Automotive Engineering"},{"text":"Aerospace Engineering"},{"text":"Additive Manufacturing"},{"text":"Computational Mechanics"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Systems"},{"text":"Advanced Manufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"A GET can eventually branch into technical specialist, engineering management or plant/operations leadership. The strongest long-term profile combines mechanical engineering depth with automation, data analytics, digital manufacturing, sustainability, reliability and business/project management."}]}]}